flowchart LR
  Viewer[Browser or operator] --> Health[GET /api/v1/health]
  Health --> HubA[RegionalFeedHub A]
  Health --> HubB[RegionalFeedHub B]
  Health --> HubC[RegionalFeedHub C]
  HubA --> StoreA[(Control state and hourly poll metrics)]
  HubB --> StoreB[(Control state and hourly poll metrics)]
  HubC --> StoreC[(Control state and hourly poll metrics)]
  HubA --> Delivery[In-memory delivery and ACK state]
  Health --> Result[Top-level ok plus regional health]
  Worker[Worker routes and static assets] -. no owned SLI contract .-> Result
  Delivery -. no retained aggregate .-> Result
  Platform[Cloudflare platform metrics] -. not bound to release evidence .-> Viewer
